    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the streets. Face the night. Trade bottles for hope.</strong><br>In this atmospheric survival experience, you play as a homeless man struggling to endure life on the streets.<br>Scavenge for bottles during the day, but beware: when the sun sets, unsettling and supernatural phenomena emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bottle counts \u2013 exchange them at the recycling machine to unlock new elements for your shelter and increase your chance of survival.<br>You're alone, with no one to rely on but yourself. Survive day by day in a world that gets darker each night</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the streets. Face the night. Trade bottles for hope.</strong><br>In this atmospheric survival experience, you play as a homeless man struggling to endure life on the streets.<br>Scavenge for bottles during the day, but beware: when the sun sets, unsettling and supernatural phenomena emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bottle counts \u2013 exchange them at the recycling machine to unlock new elements for your shelter and increase your chance of survival.<br>You're alone, with no one to rely on but yourself. Survive day by day in a world that gets darker each night</p>",
    "short_description": "As a homeless man, collect bottles by day and survive terrifying encounters by night. Trade bottles to unlock upgrades for your shelter. Alone and vulnerable, every day is a fight for survival in a world that turns darker after sunset.",
